  id: quest.ruru_last_piece
  displayName: One for the road
  description: Ruru's holding on to something from that old recipe card, and she'll only part with it for a proper supper.
  giver: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5d5225a0f63986044a63dd642f50f449, type: 2}
