  offerLine: 'Word is you''re after that old recipe card. This bit? Been using it as a bookmark for years. You can have it, but an owl''s got to eat. Three beetles, fresh from the night bush. Not the ones in your bag: I want to know they''re fresh.'
  activeLine: Three fresh beetles. You'll find them at night, on your trips.
  readyLine: Ahh. Crunchy. Right, here's your bit of card. See that R at the bottom? That's me. Took you long enough to ask.
  doneLine: Tell that young gecko I said hello.
